<body link="#CCFFFF" vlink="#FFFFCC" alink="#FFCCCC" text="#FFFFFF" background="tov_images/Background.jpg" topmargin="50">
<p align="center"><b><font face="Arial Unicode MS" color="#CDB423">VIS MAIOR RECRUITING REQUIREMENTS</font></b></p>


<body>

<div align="center">
  <center>
  <table border="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse: collapse" bordercolor="#111111" width="85%" cellspacing="4">
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <p align="center"><b><font face="Arial">The Basics - required of all 
      recruits</font></b></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <ul>
        <li>Must have the Planes of Power and Shadows of Luclin expansions.&nbsp; 
        This is where we spend 99% of our raid time, if you don't have these 
        expansions, you won't be able to join us on raids.</li>
        <li>A STABLE Internet connection (Cable/DSL preferred), your computer / 
        connection must be able to handle 70 people raids without constantly 
        going link dead.</li>
        <li>Playtime of 4 out of 7 days a week.</li>
        <li>The understanding that we are a RAIDING guild ...and if you are 
        online (as a recruit OR member) you are REQUIRED to attend all called 
        raids.</li>
        <li>5 of the 10 Vex Thal shards scattered throughout Luclin</li>
        <li>Emperor Key: at least 2 parts of the 4 are needed. Preferably the 
        ring and idol.</li>
        <li>The executioner's trial in Plane of Justice must be completed.&nbsp; 
        This will allow you to enter the Plane of Valor and Plane of Storms 
        zones. The Bastion of Thunder key and Hedge event for Plane of Nightmare 
        B are a plus. Those flags are still needed to go to the Elemental 
        Planes, where we raid most of the time.</li>
        <li>An enduring breath item (Amulet of Grey Wastes, Fishbone Earring, 
        etc).</li>
        <li>A way to shrink yourself (Cobalt Bracer, Anizok Minimizing Device, 
        spells etc)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <p align="center"><b><font face="Arial">Class Requirements</font></b></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <ul>
        <li><b>High Priority:</b><ul>
          <li>Clerics (no minimum AA's required)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>&nbsp;</li>
        <li><b>Medium Priority (50+ AA's):</b><ul>
          <li>Bard: Fading Memories, Extended Notes 3, Instrument Mastery 3, 
          Singing Mastery </li>
          <li>Druid: Healing Adept 3, Mass Group Buff, Spirit of the Wood</li>
          <li>Enchanter: Spell Casting Subtlety 3, Mass Group Buff, Gather Mana</li>
          <li>Wizard: Spell Casting Fury 3, Spell Casting Mastery 3</li>
        </ul>
        <p>&nbsp;</li>
        <li><b>Low Priority (100+ AA's):</b><ul>
          <li>Magician: Quick Summoning 3, Pet Discipline, Host of the Elements</li>
          <li>Warrior: Combat Agility 3, Combat Stability 3, Physical 
          Enhancement, Planar Power 5, Planar Durability 3, AE Taunt, Innate 
          Defense 5, Lightning Reflexes 5</li>
        </ul>
        <p>&nbsp;</li>
        <li><b>Case by Case Basis (150+ AA's):</b><ul>
          <li>Beast Lord: Spell Casting Reinforcement 3, Combat Agility 3, 
          Physical Enhancement, Paragon, Mass Group Buff, Bestial Frenzy, 
          Ambidexterity</li>
          <li>Monk</li>
          <li>Necromancer</li>
          <li>Paladin: Combat Agility 3, Combat Stability 3, Physical 
          Enhancement, Planar Power 5, Planar Durability 3, Innate Defense 5, 
          Lightning Reflexes 5</li>
          <li>Ranger: Endless Quiver, Archery Mastery 3, Fury of the Ages 3, 
          Combat Agility 3, Lightning Reflexes 5, Physical Enhancement</li>
          <li>Rogue</li>
          <li>Shaman: Cannibalization, Mass Group Buff, Spell Casting 
          Reinforcement 3</li>
          <li>Shadow Knight: Combat Agility 3, Combat Stability 3, Physical 
          Enhancement, Planar Power 5, Planar Durability 3, Innate Defense 5, 
          Lightning Reflexes 5</li>
        </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">Our family has grown to the size that we are quite happy 
      with but we also have no intention of turning away an exceptional player 
      or character. These requirements are not set in stone, if you are a truly 
      exceptional player send Keawen a tell in game and we may be able to work 
      something out.<br>
      <br>
      If you have any questions please feel free to contact Keawen in game (at 
      NON raiding times) and he will be happy to answer them.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="100%">
      <p align="center"><b><font color="#CDB423">DO YOU THINK YOU HAVE WHAT IT 
      TAKES?&nbsp; IF SO,</font></b> <a href="recruiting.asp">APPLY</a></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  </center>
</div>

</body>

